# Time-boxed exceptions for the third-party compose images.
#
# `third-party-image-scan` fails on fixable HIGH/CRITICAL findings. Every entry
# below is present in the *current* upstream image (the latest published tag,
# verified 2026-11-02) but not yet fixed: the images are either pinned to the
# newest release (caddy 2.11.7-alpine, prometheus v3.15.1, alertmanager
# v0.29.0) or the fix requires an upstream rebuild with a newer Go/Alpine
# toolchain. The repo cannot remediate these without building its own images.
#
# Re-review by the expiry date and drop each line once the upstream image is
# rebuilt. Do NOT add first-party (mct-*) image findings here; those are gated
# separately by the build-push scans.
#
# Exception list reviewed: 2026-11-02. Next review: 2026-12-01.

# --- caddy 2.11.7-alpine: Alpine package fixes awaiting an image rebuild ---
CVE-2026-111497 exp:2026-12-01  # brotli-libs 1.2.0-r0 -> 1.2.1-r0
CVE-2026-92392 exp:2026-12-01   # curl 8.22.0-r0 -> 8.23.0-r0

